1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,056
Balance time.

2
00:00:02,056 --> 00:00:03,194
Stand behind your chair

3
00:00:03,194 --> 00:00:03,728
and hold on

4
00:00:03,728 --> 00:00:04,950
with both hands.

5
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,149
Start easy.

6
00:00:06,149 --> 00:00:07,241
Lift just your heel,

7
00:00:07,241 --> 00:00:08,950
toes stay down.

8
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,370
If you feel steady,

9
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:11,055
lift your foot a

10
00:00:11,055 --> 00:00:12,790
little off the floor.

11
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:13,964
Look at one spot

12
00:00:13,964 --> 00:00:14,579
in front of you.

13
00:00:14,579 --> 00:00:15,954
It helps.

14
00:00:21,292 --> 00:00:22,151
Hold…

15
00:00:22,151 --> 00:00:23,335
you're doing great…

16
00:00:23,335 --> 00:00:24,989
and set it down.

17
00:00:25,783 --> 00:00:26,561
If you wobble,

18
00:00:26,561 --> 00:00:27,501
that's normal.

19
00:00:27,501 --> 00:00:28,105
Hold the chair

20
00:00:28,105 --> 00:00:29,248
a little tighter.

21
00:00:29,983 --> 00:00:30,981
Want more?

22
00:00:30,981 --> 00:00:31,887
Try holding on with

23
00:00:31,887 --> 00:00:33,402
just one hand.

